title lotus-audio — Lotus's reverb tone, the darkness knob
prompt recur loop — continue the Lotus/lotus-audio ladder the Long Return Lila, each finished rung its own signed round
think lotus-audio closed the pre-delay axis whole (mono·stereo, wet-domain·dry-composed); its own recommend line named the next genuinely new primitive: a darkening knob, a high-frequency roll-off on the reverberant tail so the room absorbs highs the way a real space does. By the Long Return Lila that is the highest-Lindy tractable move — a new expressive axis (spectrum, not time or level), a clean composition of two proven pieces.
think The reverb builds its combs via echo.echo, so a true in-loop Freeverb damping wants a damped-comb primitive — a bigger architectural rung. The honest first step that stands purely on proven primitives is a WET-TAIL tone: reverberate the span wet through lotus-audio reverb_preset unchanged, then roll the treble off the wet with lotus-audio tone.low_pass. tone_num==tone_den is identity; a smaller fraction darkens. I named the in-loop damping as a separate horizon rather than claiming it.
think Atomicity crux: reverb_preset writes the wet FIRST, so a bad tone coefficient checked afterward would leave a half-reverbed clip. I pre-check the tone coefficient through lotus-audio tone.precheck BEFORE reverberating, so a BadTone leaves the clip DRY. ReverbToneError = reverb_preset.ReverbPresetError || BadTone (lotus-audio BadCoeff renamed).
obs Witness GREEN on the first metal pass — no RED to book. Five laws: the identity edge (tone_num==tone_den equals reverb_preset byte for byte), it equals its composition (reverb_preset then tone.low_pass byte for byte, and the darkened tail differs from the wet), the tail darkens (summed first-difference roughness strictly less than the wet's), silence stays silence, and the faults forward atomic (BadTone with the clip still dry, DurationTooLong, BadRange). lotus-audio preset and lotus-audio low-pass re-run GREEN beside it; TAME bans clean, width exit 0.
loom witness=ales_reverb_tone_witness selftest=GREEN laws=5 max_clip=4096 bench_samples=1024
file active-designing/20260815-104206_fill-ales198-lotus-reverb-tone.md the self-approved design round naming the crux, shape, and five laws
file lotus/reverb_tone.rye the rung — the wet-tail darkness knob, lotus-audio low-pass over lotus-audio wet, prechecked before any write
file tools/ales_reverb_tone_witness.rish the witness proving five laws and re-proving lotus-audio/lotus-audio green beside it
recommend keep-going — the thin twin is stereo_reverb_tone (the same high-cut over both channels, one shared coefficient, the image held), exactly as lotus-audio followed lotus-audio; beyond it, a true in-loop damped-comb primitive is the richer horizon.
